{"type": "reveal", "fact_id": "PF2", "text": "I've reviewed the publisher's current license, and I need to flag a serious compliance issue with the draft plan. The license requires one individually assigned digital account per student and one authorized print copy per student. It permits 96 print copies for this cohort of 96 students, but it does not permit shared classroom-code access. The draft plan's proposal of 80 printed copies and shared classroom-code digital access violates the license terms. My implementation requirement is that the plan must be revised to provide 96 individually assigned digital accounts and 96 authorized print copies to comply with the publisher's license."}
```

